      "titulo": {"en": "Your turn: write and speak"},
      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write eight questions you would ask a new classmate, each with a different question word.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Ask your eight questions aloud, with the right intonation. If you have a partner, interview them."
